WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Two pages of handwriting.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.450
One is headed 1815.

3
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.810
The other, 1917.

4
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:12.540
On the first: "The Assyrian came down
like the wolf on the fold," On the second,

5
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:16.670
a line that keeps coming
back: "But nothing happens."

6
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.260
Staple them together,
and you've got an essay.

7
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.350
But is that a comparison, or just a list?

8
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.970
In this mission, you'll test
three ways to build a comparison,

9
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.850
and decide which one an examiner rewards.

10
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.170
Is hunting for similarities enough?

11
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.100
And where do the differences go?

12
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:37.180
And you'll set their voices,
rhythms and rhymes side by side,

13
00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.850
line against line.

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.620
Your mission: work out
how to compare, not list.
